{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん見ましたか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちは一緒に見てました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の総選挙。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ていた皆さんの目に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48はどんな風に写っていましたか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分たちが立ち向かおうとしている存在が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"尊敬せざるをえない方々だということ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても光栄に思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式ライバルとはいえ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだAKB48を勉強中の身としては、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援しているファンの皆さんにはまだまだ頭が上がりません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"100人いれば感じ方、考え方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同様に100通りある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の感じたこと、考えたことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分以外の人に強要するつもりは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全くありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喋ることはないと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Blogにも書きません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に深く色々な事を考えさせられたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の心の中でのみ大切に刻み込もうと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、48グループの皆様。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く皆さんと同じ土俵に立てる様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて努力していこうと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指原さん!!おめでとうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まゆゆさん!!おめでとうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"篠田さん!!自分もいつか篠田さんの様な先輩になりたいと思いました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして...キャプテン高橋さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"力強い勇気を頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はぁー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目指す頂上は本当に高いな...；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、その方がヤル気が出る!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やりがいもある!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日から改めて頑張るぞー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/06/8817889/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}